<title>USA: DSP Communications sets 2.0 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>DSP Communications sets 2.0 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSP Communications Inc on Thursday said it has set a program to repurchase two million shares from time to time in the open market.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it has completed the two million share repurchase plan that it recently initiated.</p>
<p>The company had about 43 million shares outstanding on April 23, 1997.</p>
<p>DSP Communications is a developer of microchip sets and products for cellular, personal communication services and wireless local loop markets.</p>
